  <item>
    <title>vol.3 - 开店故事：禁止撒尿，gǒng出去！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a6d367ed29175cc383270e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a6d367ed29175cc383270e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jan 2024 19:05:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客邀请了三位自主创业、从事手工艺、设计工作的朋友一起分享他们疯狂跳转的创业经历，以及在开店过程中遇到的困难和奇葩的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span>完颜慧徳老师曾曰：拱出去！今天，大家一起一吐为快，第二天依旧努力面对生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时，希望有缘的听众朋友通过本期播客，能够了解手工艺者和设计师群体他们的工作和付出，以及一件产品背后所承载的心思和心血</span></p><span></span><p><span>（ps.音频中提到的一些偏向于美术专业的内容，在末尾有放图片）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主持：老崔</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小翁、李丹、子初、贾敏</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案、封面、剪辑：老崔</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：Worldwide-磯貝一樹/Edward Black/Jamie Parker</span></p><span></span><p><span>回家-Kenny G</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>专业理想与现实——成功经验和成功个例 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>选错专业自学室内设计 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>毕业转行中的尝试 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>艺术毕业生在经营店铺中遇到的困难 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>创作和商品，该如何平和顾客的需求？ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>自己开店会出现的问题？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如何在和顾客的社交中协调自己的性格和沟通？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1917">31:57</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>某老板的经营之道 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2218">36:58</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>服务业里的客户画像 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>店内神奇事件大分享（小孩撒尿、开店遇童子尿、虚拟老公做戒指、退货来敲门、一动不动的客人、和拍照网红斗智斗勇、奇葩阿姨、心酸的“回家”、要猫、大爷大妈摘花、加杯的来源）<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2538">42:18</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>怎么和客人解释品质和拼多多的区别 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4531">1:15:31</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>手工作品背后的心血成本和直播垄断的问题<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4639">1:17:19</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>对实体经济的展望<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4763">1:19:23</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>内容图片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgjzoW5_954BMLBj9Pc0jHcyNfBS.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>佐藤幸惠｜玻璃铸造</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhqdhkz7F8GJEuNw0h_nyNbdgUz-.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>熊谷峻｜玻璃铸造</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FryJd1PuH1l4dvh5_m4wrvXcXwsy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Anne Petters ｜玻璃铸造</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FilYfLXEKrASp7TZm2eqbj3NYRoR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>翁鹏晟｜玻璃铸造</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtqsAnH4E6vWEJoF3Bl-_HnZ3EHP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>杨惠姗 &nbsp;《禅花不语众妙法》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrJrY5M5RTPyJa4-1ccO-LoR9ofK.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>朱炳仁 《千里江山》熔铜艺术</span></p>]]></description>
