  <item>
    <title>vol.2 - 书法生：什么？哪来那么多刻板印象？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657efcdd3d1caa927abf801e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657efcdd3d1caa927abf801e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Dec 2023 13:51:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客是接着上一期的内容大纲继续讨论的。除了探讨书法系学生在毕业后选择工作的问题之外（内容中提供了一些相应的求职网站和平台），我们还分享了大众对于书法生的各种刻板印象以及见见、挺挺和波吉在读书期间的快乐校园生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>应听众要求，本期聊天中出现的一些偏专业性内容我们在文本介绍下面会配上相应的图片，希望对大家有所帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主持：老崔</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：见见、挺挺、波吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案、封面、剪辑：老崔</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：Tollan Kim; Kudasaibeats - Aesthetic｜陈奕迅 - 十年</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>书法系毕业生在找工作中的局限性 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>挺挺在毕业展前一年不写字的故事 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>书法的基本功 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">05:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>关于瓶颈期 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">06:35</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>大大卷之美术教师应聘 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>天才与招考制度 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>考前机构之“庞氏骗局” <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">12:24</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>应聘小学老师当炮灰 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>内卷求职小故事“上博”、“交大保安”“人大宿管” <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>昂贵的面试集训班 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">18:32</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>聊聊考教资 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">19:48</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>给书法系毕业生的一些求职小tips（内涵网站和平台） <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>见见对书法篆刻的热爱 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1579">26:19</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>关于艺术家的职业定位 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1726">28:46</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>职业艺术家的一些现实矛盾 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>对书法学生的刻板印象 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>“潮人”古人 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2789">46:29</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>书法与喝酒 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>书法创作中的理性与感性 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>古人在现代参加展览能入选吗？ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3188">53:08</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>书法的“技”和“艺” <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3321">55:21</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>汉字和图像游戏 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3370">56:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>书法系快乐生活大分享 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3639">1:00:39</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>美院教学检查 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4060">01:07:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>内容图片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FusN8SzBqZ4sZIpUoScyixif2lM-.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>王羲之｜《兰亭集序》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoCMj-Y2BTBngae-_Bec9-uv6zcQ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>颜真卿｜《祭侄文稿》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoMVTXz44wUdIG4gFIF3-O6kbw_Y.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnDM-2EL6H0WdPNleNMHLxk59Tp_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>苏轼｜《寒食帖》（局部）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg0UziHZfWqgXlRQJX-k4eAzavJa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>铁线篆</span></p><span></span><p><span>秦 李斯｜《峄山碑》（传）</span></p>]]></description>
