  <item>
    <title>vol.1 - 三、二、一！让我们一起跳上书法这条贼船！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6565d92ec9e7cfe0252d12af</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6565d92ec9e7cfe0252d12af</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Nov 2023 12:12:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目邀请了三位书法系毕业生——“见见”、“挺挺”和“波吉”，针对有一年整个系里只有6位毕业生找到正式工作的现象，一同来聊一聊书法艺考生的毕业焦虑问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客中的所有内容仅代表个人观点，依旧还是疯狂跑题的一期，欢迎大家一起交流！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主持：老崔</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：见见、挺挺、波吉</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案/封面/剪辑：老崔</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：Club des Belugas - Kissez in Gallop</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>见见、挺挺、波及三人跳上书法贼船的故事 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">4:20</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>见见恐怖的学琴经历之喜欢砸玻璃杯的钢琴老师 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">5:30</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>某神奇高中书法特长班都上清华北大 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">9:09</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>书法专业分数线上涨 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>文化课分数对做艺术有用吗？ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>艺考结束回学校后疯狂恶补文化课 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如何正确努力 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1038">17:18</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>写书法之前想做过什么职业？<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">22:18</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>书法篆刻与化妆纹身 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>书法系扩招对书法毕业生的压力 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1480">24:40</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>考入学校之前对于未来的憧憬/学校是温室 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>有没有后悔过读书法系 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>研三毕业焦虑选择休学实习 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2042">34:02</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>考研的原因 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>拍卖行工作的同学 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">36:44</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>书法生毕业后的生存问题 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>应聘大学要准备什么？（讲课和说课） <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2629">43:49</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>大学里学的东西和工作需要学的东西 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2763">46:03</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>为了生存变社会 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>大一的理想主义 &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3083">51:23</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>读书的时候除了自己的专业以外可以做一些什么事 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3151">52:31</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>想要坚持书法所存在的现实问题 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3474">57:54</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如何达到身心平衡 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4342">1:12:22</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>（纯）艺人和艺人，给艺术生的一点小建议 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4482">1:14:42</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>书法的临摹和油画的临摹 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4830">1:20:30</a></span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
